#!/bin/sh
# Deterministic `gh` stub for spikes/git-tui PTY evidence (Issue #292).
# Returns canned JSON/text from ./data so the forge TUI renders real UI
# without network or a GitHub token. drive.py puts this dir on PATH.
DIR=$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")" && pwd)/data
case "$1" in
  --version) echo "gh version 2.82.0 (2025-01-01)"; exit 0 ;;
  auth) [ "$2" = "status" ] && exit 0 || exit 1 ;;
esac
# `gh api repos/.../<endpoint>`: route by endpoint; mutations carry
# --method/--input and get the single-object response.
if [ "$1" = "api" ]; then
  case "$*" in
    *--method*|*--input*) cat "$DIR/api.json" ;;
    */reviews*) cat "$DIR/reviews.json" ;;
    */comments*) cat "$DIR/comments.json" ;;
    */pulls/*)
      # Bare `pulls/N` GET: echo the requested number into the fixture.
      n=$(printf '%s' "$2" | sed -n 's|.*/pulls/\([0-9]*\).*|\1|p')
      [ -n "$n" ] && sed "s/\"number\": [0-9]*/\"number\": $n/" "$DIR/pull.json" || cat "$DIR/pull.json"
      ;;
    *) cat "$DIR/api.json" ;;
  esac
  exit 0
fi
cmd="$1 $2"
case "$cmd" in
  "repo view") cat "$DIR/repo-view.txt" ;;
  "pr list") cat "$DIR/pr-list.json" ;;
  "pr view")
    # `pr view N`: echo the requested number into the fixture.
    n=$(printf '%s' "$3" | sed -n 's/[0-9][0-9]*/\0/p')
    [ -n "$n" ] && sed "0,/\"number\": [0-9]*/s//\"number\": $n/" "$DIR/pr-view.json" || cat "$DIR/pr-view.json"
    ;;
  "pr create") cat "$DIR/pr-create-url.txt" ;;
  "issue list") cat "$DIR/issue-list.json" ;;
  "issue view")
    n=$(printf '%s' "$3" | sed -n 's/[0-9][0-9]*/\0/p')
    [ -n "$n" ] && sed "0,/\"number\": [0-9]*/s//\"number\": $n/" "$DIR/issue-view.json" || cat "$DIR/issue-view.json"
    ;;
  "issue create") cat "$DIR/issue-create-url.txt" ;;
  "issue edit"|"issue close"|"issue comment"|"issue reopen") cat "$DIR/issue-view.json" ;;
  *) echo "gh-stub: unsupported: $*" >&2; exit 1 ;;
esac
